flowchart LR
    DEVA[device A: add product X] --> SRV[server membership]
    DEVB[device B: remove product X - concurrent] --> SRV
    SRV --> CONFLICT{resolve, Ch 33}
    CONFLICT -->|last-writer or add-wins| FINAL[final membership]
    FINAL --> SYNC[delta sync to both devices - Ch 32]
    SYNC --> SSOT[converged per-account SSOT - Ch 3]
